THOUGHT: It seems my sed command appended the new code instead of replacing the old code. Let me fix this by replacing the entire method:

```bash
sed -i '/def __getattr__(self, name):/,/^[[:space:]]*return ""[[:space:]]*$/{
/^ *[[:space:]]*def __getattr__/!d
}' pyparsing/results.py
```

